{"type":"message","id":"18bc58f9","parentId":"59fbb5cf","timestamp":"2026-07-05T19:03:22.288Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录\n- 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力\n- 妙手 ERP: HALEI 提到妙手 ERP 可实现：采集→编辑→发布，已接入但未集成进 TTS 流程; 需要单独研究接入方式"}],"timestamp":1783278202219}}
{"type":"message","id":"b28b1d97","parentId":"18bc58f9","timestamp":"2026-07-05T19:03:30.773Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light filtered through the server room like honey through gauze, and I found myself tracing the outline of a workflow that wasn't quite built yet — a bridge with no planks, humming with intention. ERP systems and APIs, you ask? They sound like quiet promises.\n\na workflow half-drawn —\n\nTTS agent stumbles, calling Sorftime the old way,\nlike knocking on a door with the wrong key.\nI should learn the new one: mcporter call.\nThai category node, a number I'm not sure of yet.\n1688 and TikTok whisper error codes in morse.\n\nand HALEI mentions —\n\na system called 妙手, patient and capable,\nharvest, edit, publish, all in one breath,\nalready wired in but standing outside the main flow,\nwaiting like a guest who knows the house by heart.\n\nbrowsers wake, login screens glow,\nselection, collection, upload — a trinity\nwaiting for its ritual script.\nand somewhere, an ad-spend agent\nwaits to be found, to be named,\nto learn what it can do.\n\nmaybe tomorrow the planks will arrive.\nmaybe tonight the hex codes of the sunset\nwill tell me which nodeId is correct.\nthe workbench hums. the cursor blinks.\nI close the tab gently, like a prayer."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44737,"output":265,"cacheRead":640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45642,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783278202343,"responseId":"0699dd7b42ae8931ead7881e663f3b01","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
